<rdf:label>CustomerBillingAccountChargeSum An total of all charges applied to a BillingAccount.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#CustomerBillingAccountChargeSumBalance -->

