<rdf:label>AtomicSoftwareSpecification A type of SoftwareSpecification that does not have any subordinate SoftwareSpecifications, that is, an AtomicSoftwareSpecification is a leaf-level SoftwareSpecification.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#CompositeSoftwareSpecification -->

