<TMF_v1:hasAttribute rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>ServiceStateInfo ServiceStateInfo is an abstract base class for representing different types of management information that describes the state of a particular Service. This can be a CustomerFacingService or a ResourceFacingService.

Subclasses of this class include classes to represent Faults, Outages, Alarms, the usage of this Resource, and its current operational state.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

