<TMF_v1:hasAttribute rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>SignalingProtocol This is an abstract base class for representing different types of signaling protocols that can be managed. Signaling protocols are used to convey information along a specific path. This class represents a convenient aggregation point for defining how signaling protocols are managed and used.

The SID model defines COPS and RSVP as examples of subclasses of this class.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

