<rdf:label>Slot This is a concrete class that has two main purposes. One is to model the ability of a hosting board to accept a daughter card to add or complete the base functionality of the hosting board. The second is to represent the different expansion slots supported by a Chassis.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

