<rdf:label>MemoryComponent This class represents memory devices that are implemented as Chips. Note that this only represents the physical packaging of the Memory Chip - the logical functionality is defined in a separate class, called Memory, that is part of the LogicalResource model.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

