<rdf:label>CommonResourceInfo This object class defines the attributes that are common to all resource objects used in the MTOSI/MTNM interface. This class should merge up into its parent class. There is currently no merge-up stereotype to direct the implementation so the class has not been decorated.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

