<rdf:label>Revenue Assurance ABE.RA Control ABE Policy-based rules that represent the logical definition of comparisons performed on entities, such as CustomerBills and CallDetailRecords, to identify RAViolations.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#RevenueAssuranceApplicability -->

