<TMF_v1:hasAttribute rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>ClosedLoopModel Represents the strategy archetype of the closed loop. Closed loop models will generally fall under some or all of "Observe-Orient-Decide-Act" style and variants (MAPE-K, PADE, AADE, MADE, PDACE, MAI, etc.) of it.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

