<TMF_v1:hasAttribute rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdf:label>GeographicSubAddress A Geographic Sub Address "contains information in addition to that generally found in a standard single address [ANZLIC-STREET]It is an abstract modeling concept that provides a linking point to other parts of the SID model.It holds attributes common to all Geographic Sub Address subclasses.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

